{"ref":"BDB, טַף²","hw":"טַף²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">טַף</span></big><sub>42</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> coll. <strong>children (</strong>as going with <em>quick, tripping</em> steps; Ethiopic ጣፍ: Di <sup>1251</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">טַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">Je 41:16</a> + 11 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">טָ֑ף</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.7\">Je 40:7</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טַפֵּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:8\" href=\"/Genesis.43.8\">Gn 43:8</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">טַפְּכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:19\" href=\"/Genesis.45.19\">Gn 45:19</a> + 10 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">טַפָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:29\" href=\"/Genesis.34.29\">Gn 34:29</a> + 6 times; never cstr. and never pl. (in <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:24\" href=\"/Genesis.47.24\">Gn 47:24</a> om. 𝔊, cf. Di);—<em>children, little ones</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:29\" href=\"/Genesis.34.29\">Gn 34:29</a> (E) + 18 times JE (Gn Ex Nu), also <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:39\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.39\">Dt 1:39</a> + 8 times D (incl. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:14\" href=\"/Joshua.1.14\">Jos 1:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:35\" href=\"/Joshua.8.35\">8:35</a>); P only <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:9\" href=\"/Numbers.31.9\">Nu 31:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:17\" href=\"/Numbers.31.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:18\" href=\"/Numbers.31.18\">18</a>, where note <span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָר בַּטָּ֑ף</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:17\" href=\"/Numbers.31.17\">17</a> = <em>young boys</em>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">הַטַּף בַּנָּשִׁים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:18\" href=\"/Numbers.31.18\">18</a> = <em>young girls;</em> also <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:21\" href=\"/Judges.18.21\">Ju 18:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:10\" href=\"/Judges.21.10\">21:10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.22\">2 S 15:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.7\">Je 40:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">41:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.6\">43:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.6\">Ez 9:6</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.13\">2 Ch 20:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.18\">31:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:21\" href=\"/Ezra.8.21\">Ezr 8:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:13\" href=\"/Esther.3.13\">Est 3:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:11\" href=\"/Esther.8.11\">8:11</a>; the words <span dir=\"rtl\">מְתִים וְנָשִׁים וְהַטָּ֑ף</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.34\">Dt 2:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.6\">3:6</a> incl. all inhabitants; so <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנָשִׁים וְהַנָּשִׁים וְהַטָּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.12\">Dt 31:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.7\">Je 40:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.6\">43:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טַף</span> distinguished from <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחוּר וּבְתוּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.6\">Ez 9:6</a>; also from <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.13\">2 Ch 20:13</a>, and from <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵיהֶם וּבְנוֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.18\">2 Ch 31:18</a>. Note that the word includes (or implies) <em>women</em> as well as children, in foll.: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:12\" href=\"/Genesis.47.12\">Gn 47:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:37\" href=\"/Exodus.12.37\">Ex 12:37</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:10\" href=\"/Exodus.10.10\">10:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:24\" href=\"/Exodus.10.24\">24</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:16\" href=\"/Numbers.32.16\">Nu 32:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:17\" href=\"/Numbers.32.17\">17</a> (JE; cf. Di on v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:26\" href=\"/Numbers.32.26\">26</a>).","next":"BDB, טָפַשׁ","prev":"BDB, טָפַף"}